              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "marybcurlyq"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I've been making these cookies since I was old enough to help my mom. I have never added nuts, but I'm sure that would be a good addition. Also, I add the peanut butter AFTER I take the saucepan off of the heat...I find it helps the cookies maintain some firmness."
          },
