            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Fernon"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I had the issue with these not setting as well the first time. Here is the trick.....do not add the peanut butter in the saucepan. Mix it with the oats instead. I bring the cocoa, milk, butter, sugar mixture to a boil slowly and once boiling, boil for 2 minutes only. The 5-20 wass way too long.",
